      "title": "Technician OPS",
      "description": "Job Title Technician OPS Next Job Apply for Job Job ID 63646 Location Tallahassee, FL Full/Part Time Regular/Temporary Temporary Add to My Favorite Jobs Email this Job Department The FAMU-FSU College of Engineering is pleased to announce the acceptance of qualified applications for the Computer Technician (OPS) position within Information Technology Services (ITS) . Responsibilities Providing excellent, responsive service to our college customers (faculty, staff and students) when they contact our office (walk in or call in); Handle simple technical issues; Assist more senior teammates with various projects, including personal computer and classroom technology support. Qualifications A high school diploma or equivalency and some experience with customer service roles and supporting personal computers. Good basic knowledge of Microsoft Windows and Microsoft Office. Commitment to providing excellent customer service. Good communications skills. Prepared to work well in a team-oriented environment. University Information One of the nation's elite research universities, Florida State University preserves, expands, and disseminates knowledge in the sciences, technology, arts, humanities, and professions, while embracing a philosophy of learning strongly rooted in the traditions of the liberal arts and critical thinking. Founded in 1851, Florida State University is the oldest continuous site of higher education in Florida. FSU is a community steeped in tradition that fosters research and encourages creativity. At FSU, there’s the excitement of being part of a vibrant academic and professional community, surrounded by people whose ideas are shaping tomorrow’s news! Learn more about Florida State University and our campuses . How To Apply If qualified and interested in a specific job opening as advertised, apply through the FSU Careers site (jobs.fsu.edu). If you are a current FSU employee, apply through myFSU Self Service. Applicants are required to complete the online application with all applicable information. Applications must include all work history up to ten years, and education details even if attaching a resume. Considerations This is an OPS/temporary job. Based on the duties, this position may require completion of a criminal history background check . Equal Employment Opportunity FSU is an Equal Employment Opportunity Employer. Apply for Job"
